      "text": "Submit",
      "udi": "umb://element/f0ae6c5a54734edca757e89e1e28a056"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "6da482da-a53c-4df3-8fd4-697a7d91bbac",
      "hint": {
        "markup": "<p>You should only ask users to upload something if it’s critical to the delivery of your service.</p>\n<p>This file upload has its label set as the page heading.</p>\n<p>The choose file dialog will only allow selection of an image based on its media types, but any file can be uploaded using drag and drop.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "label": "{{name}}",
      "udi": "umb://element/ddb17629a8f54216a321bf8cd31dbd3c"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "6da482da-a53c-4df3-8fd4-697a7d91bbac",
      "hint": {
        "markup": "<p>The validation should fail if the file is not an Excel file. The validation will look at the binary file header to determine whether the file is an Excel file.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "label": "Upload an Excel file",
      "udi": "umb://element/789d8ea2fc184bb9b99e1e161b11de68"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "6da482da-a53c-4df3-8fd4-697a7d91bbac",
      "hint": {
        "markup": "<p>The validation should fail if the file is not a PDF file. The validation will look at the binary file header to determine whether the file is a PDF file.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "label": "Upload a PDF file",
      "udi": "umb://element/8dc5375350884c30861bba4b8d35ab56"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "6da482da-a53c-4df3-8fd4-697a7d91bbac",
      "hint": {
        "markup": "<p>The validation will fail if the file is above 5MB.</p>",
